    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63624" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῐτᾰν-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιτή</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>praying, suppliant</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					809
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.): as Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιτανά, τά,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιταί, ἀμφὶ λιτάν᾽
				ἕξομεν</span>
			 engage in <i>prayer</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Th.</u>
				102
			</span></i> (Seidler for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφίλιταν</span> or
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφὶ λιτὰν</span>).</div>
